[2025-09-23 19:28:36] local.INFO: VNDB ulist response {"page":1,"status":200,"ok":true,"body":"{\"more\":true,\"results\":[{\"id\":\"v3\",\"labels\":[{\"label\":\"Wishlist\"}],\"vn\":{\"description\":\"[url=/c411]Hakuoro[/url], a man who wakes up in a tiny backwoods village near the mountains with heavy injuries, no memory, and a mask he cannot remove. After being nursed back to health by [url=/c412]Eruruu[/url], the girl who found him lying at the point of death in the forest, he starts to view the village as his new home. But when an oppressive ruler threatens the peaceful life of Hakuoro and his newfound friends and family, they find themselves hurtled towards war, chaos, and a destiny far greater than any of them imagined.\\n\\n[From [url=http://mirrormoon.org/projects/utawarerumono]Mirror Moon[/url]]\",\"developers\":[{\"id\":\"p21\",\"name\":\"Leaf\"},{\"id\":\"p87\",\"name\":\"AQUAPLUS\"},{\"id\":\"p4153\",\"name\":\"STING\"}],\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://t.vndb.org/cv/27/89127.jpg\"},\"languages\":[\"en\",\"es\",\"ja\",\"ko\",\"ru\",\"zh-Hans\",\"zh-Hant\"],\"rating\":78.4,\"released\":\"2002-04-26\",\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"g4\",\"name\":\"Magic\"},{\"id\":\"g6\""}
[2025-09-23 19:28:36] local.INFO: VNDB ulist request {"page":2,"payload":{"user":"u220281","fields":"vn.id,vn.title,vn.description,vn.image.url,vn.tags.name,vn.developers.name,vn.languages,labels.label,vote,vn.rating,vn.released","results":100,"page":2}}
[2025-09-23 19:28:36] local.INFO: VNDB ulist response {"page":2,"status":200,"ok":true,"body":"{\"more\":true,\"results\":[{\"id\":\"v7803\",\"labels\":[{\"label\":\"Wishlist\"}],\"vn\":{\"description\":\"A story that takes place in a fictional world...\\n\\nIt was the 1st of August.\\n\\nThat morning, when she awoke, the heroine found herself without any memories from before August 1st...... Everything, from the sort of life she lived, to the relationships she had, was a blank......\\n\\nA young boy named Orion appeared in front of her, referring to himself as a \\\"spirit.\\\" Under Orion's guidance, the heroine began the struggle to regain her memories. She searched her house for clues about her everyday life, and received a message on her phone...\\n\\nWhat was displayed on the screen was an unknown name to her.\\n\\nNow, she is asked to meet with him, a boyfriend whose name and face she doesn't know. In a position where who to trust is uncertain, the heroine must move in a way that her memory loss remains undetected by her partner. Because of this, the story becomes tangled in complex ways.\\n\\nWith no memo"}
[2025-09-23 19:28:36] local.INFO: VNDB ulist request {"page":3,"payload":{"user":"u220281","fields":"vn.id,vn.title,vn.description,vn.image.url,vn.tags.name,vn.developers.name,vn.languages,labels.label,vote,vn.rating,vn.released","results":100,"page":3}}
[2025-09-23 19:28:36] local.INFO: VNDB ulist response {"page":3,"status":200,"ok":true,"body":"{\"more\":true,\"results\":[{\"id\":\"v13943\",\"labels\":[{\"label\":\"Wishlist\"},{\"label\":\"PC\"}],\"vn\":{\"description\":\"The protagonist is a famous soccer player, but due to a leg injury from a game, he must now rest until it heals. When he returns home, he is warmly greeted by his 4 older sisters whom he hasn't seen for a long time.\\n\\nHowever, because his clubmates have play a prank on him and fill his bag with ero manga, their relationships immediately plummet after they find out about it.\\n\\nWhile trying to explain the situation to no avail, one of them suggests that they themselves should help him escape the 2D world and be interested in healthy adult women. Little does he know, all of his sisters love him more than a brother.\\n\\nAnd so, this is the beginning of a ridiculous erotic life between our protagonist and his 4 tempting older sisters.\\n\\n[Translated from [url=http://www.a-kaguya.com/products_bb/bakuane/story.html]Official Site[/url]]\",\"developers\":[{\"id\":\"p3903\",\"name\":\"Atelier Kaguya"}
[2025-09-23 19:28:36] local.INFO: VNDB ulist request {"page":4,"payload":{"user":"u220281","fields":"vn.id,vn.title,vn.description,vn.image.url,vn.tags.name,vn.developers.name,vn.languages,labels.label,vote,vn.rating,vn.released","results":100,"page":4}}
[2025-09-23 19:28:37] local.INFO: VNDB ulist response {"page":4,"status":200,"ok":true,"body":"{\"more\":true,\"results\":[{\"id\":\"v18334\",\"labels\":[{\"label\":\"Wishlist\"}],\"vn\":{\"description\":\"High school student Akamatsu Kaede is kidnapped and awakens trapped in Ultimate Academy for Gifted Juveniles, where she meets 15 fellow students including Saihara Shuuichi. The group is abruptly accosted by a series of bear robots, known as Monokubs who expose them to a \\\"Flashback Light,\\\" a flashlight similar to a neuralyzer. When Kaede next awakens the students, they remember having ultimate talents, with Kaede as the \\\"Ultimate Pianist\\\" and Shuuichi as the \\\"Ultimate Detective\\\". Monokuma - a robotic bear - arrives and informs the students that the only way to escape the academy is to successfully murder another student and not be voted as the culprit at the resulting trial.\\n\\n[Edited from [url=https://www.imdb.com/title/tt6184830/plotsummary/]IMDB[/url]]\",\"developers\":[{\"id\":\"p2807\",\"name\":\"Spike Chunsoft\"}],\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://t.vndb.org/cv/17/75817.jpg\"},\"languages\":[\"en\",\"fr\",\"ja\","}
